title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/kcp_party_organizations.png
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the KCP runs a social world onto itself.

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, the KCP is a social world and friend group onto itself.

- @newspapers: Expand our media outreach.
- @welfare: Fund our non-socialist workers trade union.
- @culture: Fund cultural programmes.
- @rb: Fund the black militia.
- @youth: Support the political "youth" of Kaddu.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

# TODO: differing outcomes based on whether you've seen media, and what kind of media you've supported.


@welfare
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_kcp += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to our workers union this boosts our electorate among workers.

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; cultural_organizations += 1; socialist_dissent -= 6; humanist_dissent -= 6; liberal_dissent -= 6; constitutionalist_dissent -= 6; neoforsvollrist_dissent -= 6

We organize feasts , cultural festivals and other activites to keep our members happy.

@rb
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rb_strength  += 100; rb_militancy += 0.01; reichsbanner_timer = 0; funded_reichsbanner += 1

We have increased funding for our militia

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rb_strength += 50; rb_militancy += 0.02; young_socialists += 1; socialist_strength += 5; neoforsvollrist_strength += 5; radicalization += 1;

We fund the new political youth of Kaddu through youth leagues and organizations. Most however flock to our most radical wings both on the left and right.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
